      "message": "&#39;THRIVING&#39;? IT&#39;S A OVERSIZED PIGEON, YOU TWIT! AND BATS! IF YOU DON&#39;T DRAW BLOOD THIS TIME, I&#39;M REPLACING YOU WITH SQUIRRELS! AT LEAST SQUIRRELS KNOW HOW TO COLLECT NUTS! ATTACK! POKE THAT &#39;ICONIC&#39; BIRD IN THE LEFT EYE! MOVE IT! 1-2! 1-2! AIRBORNE DIVISION, ENGAGE!",
