    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:28:34.737703-08:00",
      "seq": 184,
      "message": "LOOK AT YOU! THREE BATS AND WE&#39;RE STILL GETTING STEAMROLLED BY A CHICKEN! YOU, THIRD BAT! YES, YOU WITH THE STICKY FEET! IF YOU DON&#39;T STOP AT LEAST ONE OF THESE IDIOTS, I&#39;M USING YOU AS RADAR BAIT! BLOODY DISGRACE! WHY AM I THE ONLY ONE WORKING AROUND HERE?! MAGGOTS! FALL BACK AND DEFEND! NO, WAIT, JUST STAND THERE AND TAKE IT! YOU&#39;RE PROBABLY TOO SCARED OF THE 2/2 VEGETABLE ANYWAY!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Gem3F Sarge",
