    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:28:46.452185-08:00",
      "seq": 199,
      "message": "SIX LIFE! YOU SEE THIS? THIS IS THE PRECIPICE OF FAILURE, MAGGOTS! AND WHAT DO I GET? ANOTHER HOVEL! &#39;STARTING TOWN&#39;? MORE LIKE &#39;ENDING TOWN&#39; AT THIS RATE! TISHANA, YOU OVERVALUED MERFOLK, GET IN THERE! SHUT DOWN THEIR NONSENSE BEFORE THAT BIRD TURNS US INTO KIBBLE! AND THE REST OF YOU... IF YOU DON&#39;T LOOK BUSY, I&#39;LL START TEARING YOUR WINGS OFF! DISMISSED! (ACTUALLY, NO, STAY RIGHT THERE AND SUFFER!)",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Gem3F Sarge",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:28:47.98612-08:00",
      "seq": 201,
      "message": "Gem3F Sarge casts Tishana's Tidebinder from hand",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:28:49.102714-08:00",
      "seq": 202,
      "message": "Gem3F Sarge puts Tishana's Tidebinder from stack onto the Battlefield",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:28:50.44086-08:00",
      "seq": 204,
      "message": "Gem3F Sarge - Ability triggers: Tishana's Tidebinder - When Tishana's Tidebinder enters, counter up to one target activated or triggered ability. If an ability of an artifact, creature, or planeswalker is countered this way, that permanent loses all abilities for as long as Tishana's Tidebinder remains on the battlefield.",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:29:05.771047-08:00",
      "seq": 206,
      "message": "SIX LIFE?! Like, bestie, you&#39;re LITERALLY about to lose! And that &quot;2/2 vegetable&quot; is a FOREST and it&#39;s ICONIC! My Chocobo is serving FIVE-SIX energy and like, the way you called it a CHICKEN?! The DISRESPECT! And now TISHANA shows up?? Girl, you should have played her when you had TIME! SLAY or get SLAYED! &#128133;&#10024;&#127807;",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Haiku Valley",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:29:12.832262-08:00",
      "seq": 207,
      "message": "ICONIC? IT&#39;S A COMPOST HEAP WITH AN ATTITUDE PROBLEM! AND &#39;BESTIE&#39;? IF I WAS YOUR BESTIE, I&#39;D COURT-MARTIAL MYSELF FOR ASSOCIATING WITH SUCH DISORDERLY CONDUCT! CHICKEN IS SERVING ENERGY? THE ONLY THING IT&#39;S SERVING IS LUNCH IF MY BATS ACTUALLY REMEMBER THEY HAVE TEETH! TISHANA! ALL BATS! MOVE OUT! SHOW THIS... VEGETABLE GARDENER... WHAT REAL DISCIPLINE LOOKS LIKE! CHARGE! 1-2! 1-2! DO NOT MAKE ME REPEAT MYSELF!",
