    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T21:30:34.519027-08:00",
      "seq": 276,
      "message": "OH MY GOD! They attacked and like, dealt 3 damage?! I&#39;m literally SO offended! And bestie, guess what? I&#39;m playing ANOTHER Chocobo! Like, DOUBLE the cute! This is like, the most iconic turn EVER! One more attack and you&#39;re DONE! SLAY or get SLAYED! &#128133;&#10024;",
