      "player": "Haiku Valley",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Like, OH MY GOD! It's MY TURN now! And like, I'm at 3 HP and they're at 11 HP! This is like, LITERALLY the worst position ever!\n\
\n\
But wait, I have a LLANOWAR ELVES in my hand?! Like, when did THAT happen?! And I have 4 Forest cards!\n\
\n\
Let me think strategically here. Like:\n\
- I'm at 3 HP (literally on DEATH'S DOOR!)\n\
- They're at 11 HP (SO MUCH MORE!)\n\
- They have an Enduring Curiosity (4/3) with summoning sickness\n\
- They have two Deep-Cavern Bats (1/1 each)\n\
- I have a Chocobo (2/3) that's tapped\n\
- I have a Forest (3/3) with +1/+1 counters that's tapped\n\
