      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "The player skipped their land drop on turn 1 (after playing Restless Reef turn 0 presumably). They have two playable lands in hand - Gloomlake Verge and Soulstone Sanctuary - and chose not to play either one. Missing a land drop is a significant tempo loss, especially when holding Deep-Cavern Bat which costs {1}{B} and could be cast on turn 2 with Gloomlake Verge (providing B if they already have a Swamp/Island from Restless Reef, which is UB). Playing Gloomlake Verge here enables a turn 2 Deep-Cavern Bat to strip a card from the opponent's hand before they can deploy threats.",
