      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem3F Sarge skipped their land drop on turn 2 despite having two lands in hand (Gloomlake Verge and Soulstone Sanctuary). With Restless Reef as the only land (which enters tapped and was likely their turn 1 play), they need to develop mana to cast their spells. Gloomlake Verge would provide U or B mana (once they control an Island or Swamp), and Soulstone Sanctuary provides colorless mana. Playing Gloomlake Verge here would set up casting Deep-Cavern Bat (1B) or Bitterbloom Bearer (BB) on turn 3 with two lands. Missing this land drop puts them a full turn behind on mana development with a hand full of 2-4 mana spells.",
